 circuitry for receiving data from said first user to be associated with said first account; 
 circuitry for recognizing a second computing device in response to plugging said data storage device into said second computing device; 
 circuitry for creating a second account on said data storage device for a second user, wherein said second account is associated with said second user and said second computing device; 
