A display device, comprising:
a plurality of pixel units each including at least a pixel for displaying a first viewpoint image and a pixel for displaying a second viewpoint image, each pixel including a pixel electrode and a storage capacitance; 
data lines for supplying display data to the pixel electrodes; 
pixel switches for transmitting display data signals from the data lines to the pixel electrodes; 
gate lines for controlling the pixel switches; 
contact holes for electrically connecting the pixel electrodes and the storage capacitances in the pixels; and 
an optical element for distributing light emitted from each of the pixels configuring the pixel units towards different directions, wherein 
a direction towards which the pixel for the first viewpoint and the pixel for the second viewpoint are arranged in a repeated manner is a first direction, 
