A method for fabricating a fractally attributively delamination resistive composite structure, the method comprising:
providing a plurality of layers comprising composite materials;
forming at least one interface between at least two adjacent layers of the plurality of layers, wherein the at least one interface comprises a fractal geometry;
stacking the plurality of layers including said at least one interface with fractal geometry;
consolidating the stacked layers to form a unified composite structure;
