   a sensing region disposed adjacent to the metal layer, said sensing region being configured to receive a sample; and
   a detector configured to detect a change in a characteristic of said surface plasmon resonance responsive to an interaction between the sample and the metal layer in the sensing region.

A ferroelectric field effect transistor device, comprising:
