wherein the control module is further configured to enable the voltage conversion stage to provide the auxiliary bias voltage during a first operational state of the power supply, and to disable the voltage conversion stage or reduce its operation during a second operational state of the power supply when a main bias source is active.

A QPSK modulation signal receiving unit, comprising:
