An ohmmeter system, comprising:
a current source configured to apply a known current across an unknown resistance;
a voltage sensing circuit configured to measure an analog voltage drop across the unknown resistance;
an analog-to-digital converter operably coupled to the voltage sensing circuit, the analog-to-digital converter configured to convert the measured analog voltage drop into a digital voltage signal;
a processing unit operably coupled to the analog-to-digital converter, the processing unit configured to calculate a digital resistance value based on the known current and the digital voltage signal; and
an output interface operably coupled to the processing unit, the output interface configured to present the digital resistance value.

A method for power adaptation in a multi-station network, the method comprising:
