determining, by the first station, a transmit power level for subsequent transmissions based on the evaluated characteristic; and
transmitting, by the first station, a subsequent communication signal using the determined transmit power level;
wherein the determined transmit power level is configured to maintain a target communication quality for the subsequent communication signal while substantially optimizing energy efficiency of the first station.

A method for adaptive brain stimulation, comprising:
