a second end configured for electrically coupling to a corresponding conductive contact of a mating connector, wherein said housing is further configured to provide electrical isolation between said at least one conductive contact and any other conductive contacts of the electric connector.

A method for providing electronic bill payment and presentment, the method comprising:
