a substrate stage configured to hold the substrate;
an immersion liquid supply system configured to supply an immersion liquid into a space between the projection system and the substrate;
and a pressure sensor configured to measure pressure of the immersion liquid in the space between the projection system and the substrate.

A radiofrequency amplifier, comprising:
