a radiofrequency output port configured to provide an amplified radiofrequency output signal;
an active amplifying component electrically coupled between the radiofrequency input port and the radiofrequency output port, the active amplifying component configured to amplify the input radiofrequency signal;
a biasing circuit configured to provide operating power to the active amplifying component;
an input impedance matching network coupled between the radiofrequency input port and an input of the active amplifying component, the input impedance matching network configured to match an impedance of the radiofrequency input port to an input impedance of the active amplifying component; and
an output impedance matching network coupled between an output of the active amplifying component and the radiofrequency output port, the output impedance matching network configured to match an output impedance of the active amplifying component to an impedance of the radiofrequency output port.

An apparatus, comprising:
