determining one or more treatment parameters for the received substrate;
generating a sequence of machine-executable control instructions based on the one or more determined treatment parameters; and
operating a substrate treatment apparatus to apply a treatment to the substrate according to the generated sequence of machine-executable control instructions.

A rotation-angle-detecting apparatus, comprising:
