    a stationary member positioned relative to the rotatable member;
    a sensing arrangement configured to generate a signal indicative of a relative angular position between the rotatable member and the stationary member;
    a processing unit communicatively coupled to the sensing arrangement, the processing unit configured to determine the rotation angle of the rotatable member based on the generated signal; and
    an output interface configured to provide the determined rotation angle.

1. An imaging apparatus, comprising:
