from about 1 wt% to about 50 wt% of at least one electrically conductive filler; and
optionally, one or more additives selected from the group consisting of plasticizers, stabilizers, processing aids, flame retardants, colorants, and mixtures thereof;
wherein said electrically conductive thermoplastic elastomer composition has an electrical volume resistivity of less than about 10^9 ohm-cm; and
wherein said article is formed from said electrically conductive thermoplastic elastomer composition.

A pump system comprising:
