a priming circuit fluidly connected to said main pump, said priming circuit comprising a priming pump and a priming valve, said priming pump configured to draw air from at least one of said suction inlet and a casing of said main pump;
a sensor configured to detect a priming condition of said main pump, said priming condition comprising at least one of a presence of liquid at said suction inlet and a vacuum level within said main pump casing; and
a controller communicatively coupled to said sensor, said priming pump, and said priming valve, said controller configured to automatically activate said priming pump and operate said priming valve based on said detected priming condition, wherein said operation of said priming valve facilitates removal of air from said main pump to enable establishment of a prime for said main pump.

A system comprising:
