delaying transmission of the determined geographic position and any associated emergency information for a predefined duration or until a predefined criterion is met;
transmitting the determined geographic position and any associated emergency information to a designated recipient upon expiration of the predefined duration or satisfaction of the predefined criterion.

A camera comprising:
