a control unit configured to selectively operate said film receiving and transport mechanism and said shutter mechanism for silver-salt image capture or to selectively operate said electronic image sensor and said shutter mechanism for electronic image capture; and
an electronic memory coupled to said electronic image sensor for storing image data generated by said electronic image sensor.

1. A shift register, comprising:
    a plurality of serially connected stages, each stage having an input terminal and an output terminal;
    a data input terminal configured to receive an initial data signal;
    at least one clock input terminal configured to receive at least one clock signal;
    wherein each of the plurality of stages is configured to receive a data input signal from a preceding stage's output terminal or the data input terminal;
    wherein each stage further comprises:
        a data storage element configured to store a data value;
        and a control logic circuit coupled to the data storage element, the input terminal, and the at least one clock input terminal, the control logic circuit configured to:
            load the data input signal into the data storage element in response to a first phase of the at least one clock signal; and
            transfer the stored data value from the data storage element to the output terminal of the stage in response to a second phase of the at least one clock signal;
    whereby data values are sequentially propagated from the data input terminal through the plurality of serially connected stages, generating a series of synchronized output signals at the output terminals of the respective stages.

1. A computer mainframe housing for a computer, comprising:
