a privacy-preserving authentication module integrated within the payment processing system, said privacy-preserving authentication module configured to verify user and merchant identities without disclosing full personal identifiable information (PII) during transaction authorization;

a data encryption module configured to encrypt all sensitive data both at rest and in transit across the network;

a fraud detection engine configured to analyze transaction patterns and user behavior to detect and flag suspicious activities indicative of identity theft; and

a secure communication module configured to establish encrypted communication channels among the plurality of user devices, the plurality of merchant terminals, and the payment processing system.

