    transmitting a deactivation command to the BTS, wherein the deactivation command directs the BTS to cease transmitting and receiving wireless signals and to sever its logical connection with a core network of the wireless communication system;
    receiving a deactivation confirmation from the BTS;
    updating a network topology database to reflect the BTS as removed or inactive; and
    authorizing physical disconnection of the BTS from the wireless communication system following receipt of the deactivation confirmation.

